\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> (uncountable regular cardinal)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GeneralizedSuslinTree}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{GeneralizedSuslinTree}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S\\)</span> (regular-cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"58-df-regular-cardinal\">58-df-regular-cardinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KappaTree}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{KappaTree}_S\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>-tree predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"fa77c5c28538fe4e\" href=\"?note=fa77c5c28538fe4e\" title=\"58-df-tree-prop\">58-df-tree-prop</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Chain}\">\\(\\mathrm{Chain}\\)</span> (chain predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Antichain}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Antichain}_S\\)</span> (antichain predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}generalized\\text{-}suslin\\text{-}tree}\\vdash\\mathrm{GeneralizedSuslinTree}_S(T,&lt;_{T},\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega&lt;\\kappa\\land\\mathrm{KappaTree}_S(T,&lt;_{T},\\kappa)\\land\\neg\\exists C\\subseteq T\\;\\bigl(|C|=\\kappa\\land\\mathrm{Chain}(C,T,&lt;_{T})\\bigr)\\land\\neg\\exists A\\subseteq T\\;\\bigl(|A|=\\kappa\\land\\mathrm{Antichain}_S(A,T,&lt;_{T})\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}generalized\\text{-}suslin\\text{-}tree}\\vdash\\mathrm{GeneralizedSuslinTree}_S(T,&lt;_{T},\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega&lt;\\kappa\\land\\mathrm{KappaTree}_S(T,&lt;_{T},\\kappa)\\land\\neg\\exists C\\subseteq T\\;\\bigl(|C|=\\kappa\\land\\mathrm{Chain}(C,T,&lt;_{T})\\bigr)\\land\\neg\\exists A\\subseteq T\\;\\bigl(|A|=\\kappa\\land\\mathrm{Antichain}_S(A,T,&lt;_{T})\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A Suslin tree is an <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_1\">\\(\\omega_1\\)</span>-tree with no uncountable chains or antichains.</li>\n<li>Under <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MA}+\\neg\\mathrm{CH}\">\\(\\mathrm{MA}+\\neg\\mathrm{CH}\\)</span>, there are no Suslin trees.</li>\n<li>Existence of an <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_1\">\\(\\omega_1\\)</span>-Suslin tree is independent of ZFC; this atom defines the property and does not assert existence.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"thm-suslin-tree-—-Suslin-Tree","text":"thm-suslin-tree — Suslin Tree","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-tree-prop","status":"resolved","id":"fa77c5c28538fe4e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-tree-prop]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-regular-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"0fbfc19800246e77","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-regular-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-chain","status":"resolved","id":"a07664003abe8d32","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-chain]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-antichain","status":"resolved","id":"b98049bc73009c64","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-antichain]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinality","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":""